[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふっ……久しぶりに、暴れられた……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh... haven't let loose like that in ages..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゼロ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "全力でやっても死なない相手……満足、じゃ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "An opponent who doesn't die even when I go all-out... I'm satisfied..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Zero"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんか満足して倒れたんすけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did she really just collapse because she was satisfied...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほんと、いくつになっても子どもだねえ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Some things never change, no matter how old you get."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イェルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jelka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まったくだ。いくら力が強くても頭が幼い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Precisely. All that power, and the mind of a child to go with it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこを付けこまれるから格下相手に不覚を取る",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's why she lets her guard down against lesser opponents."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "妹に対して、その言い草はないんじゃないの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's a little harsh, isn't it? She's your sister."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや？\u3000その点俺は、力も頭脳も完璧な英雄だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmph. I, on the other hand, am a perfect hero—both in strength and in mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヘルト",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "万が一にも不覚はない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A flawless record. Not a single misstep."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Held"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういうこと口にする輩ほど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Funny how the ones who say things like that..."
